window.products.push({"id":857221,"name":"Lemfema Wood Stove Fan, Fireplace Fan with Magnetic Thermometer, Slient Heat Powered Stove Fan for Wood/Log Burner/Fireplace/Pellet (4 Blades)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181BRCfGHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":">[UNIQUE DESIGN]: No battery or power Required - The use of thermal power generation fan, used to cycle the hot air produced by wood burning fireplace. There is a thermoelectric module on the fan, which acts as a generator to drive the motor of the fan. When the generator experiences the heat difference between the top and bottom surfaces, it generates current. >[Less Consumption More Efficiency]: This set of stove accessories will help save your fuel, which could reduce the wood usage nearly by 28% searched by our team. And there is no need for batteries or electricity, it could also improve the circulation of hot air. >[SIMPLE OPERATE ]: Putting the fan on the furnace will absorb heat energy to drive the fan to rotate, blow the hot air above the fireplace to the living area, increase the air circulation in the room and improve the heating efficiency of the furnace. The rotation speed of the fan depends on the temperature of the furnace. When the temperature of the furnace is high, the rotation speed is fast. When the temperature of the furnace is low enough go out, the rotation speed will slow down to stop. >[PREMIUM QUALITY]: Made of high temperature resistant and anti-oxidation anodized aluminum. Even if it works at high temperature for a long time, it will not deform or change color, rust or corrosion. No installation required. just put the stove fan on the top of stove, the fan will spin with the temperature getting higher. >[Guarantee and Service]: This set of stove fan comes with one-year warranty. Our customer care team is available and ready to assist you. Simply email us with your order number and we'll get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181BRCfGHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lemfema","source_asin":"B0BRXJQYGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXJQYGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXJQYGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
