window.products.push({"id":857253,"name":"Gezocaromo Mid Century Abstract Shower Curtain, Boho Geometric Leaf Modern Minimalist Neutral Home Bathroom Bathtub Curtain Decoration Durable Fabric ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kY4OIjWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【UNIQUE DESIGN】Boho shower curtain patterns are all self-designed,you can choose a variety of styles.The size is 72 x 72 inches,and use HD digital printing to ensure vivid colors.Believe you can enjoy bathing time by using our fabric shower curtain! 【WATERPROOF MATERIAL】This bathroom shower curtain is made with polyester fabric which is waterproof, quick-drying, durable and lightweight, perfect for creating a comfortable bathing environment. 【EASY INSTALL】The Mid century abstract shower curtain includes 12 plastic curtain hooks and reinforced metal grommets, it can be used for a long time and easy to install and slide. 【MULTIPURPOSE CURTAIN】Minimalist shower curtain not only a bath curtain, but also a themed blackout cloth, window curtain, partition background. 【WASHING TIPS】Hand or machine washable in cold water and do not use bleach. Wipe clean fabric shower curtain with cloth and open it to dry after each use.If there are wrinkles, please iron it gently at lower temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kY4OIjWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gezocaromo","source_asin":"B0B81YVG5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B81YVG5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B81YVG5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":857254,"name":"Glass Meal Prep Containers, Set of 3 - Meal Portion Control Container by Lofte - BPA-Free, Food Safe Lunch Organizers with Dividers for Packed Lunches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7120Dtj436L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthy Habits Start At Home One of the best values you can instill in your children is the understanding of what good, quality food tastes like and how it affects how we feel. The problem isn’t so much that kids just don’t like healthy food; the problem is that it takes a lot of time, patience, and effort to be willing to instill the value of cooking in a child. Our kitchen meal prep containers destress your life in that you can easily store pre-made and pre-planned food in your kitchen, freezer, or cooler. Throw away the frozen, packaged food. This means you will have delicious alternatives throughout the week that won’t spoil or go bad. It also instills the importance of not wasting food. Your kids will love helping you use these meal prepping bento boxes. A Perfect Way To Portion Food Many people struggle with portion control and sizes. It’s no wonder! If you go out ot eat at almost any restaurant these days, you end up with a single plate that looks like it should feed an entire family. We have a tendency to eat whatever is in front of us, whether we are full or not. With these adult meal prep containers for portion control, you can actually pre plan you meals based on weight and size and only take with you necessary amount of food. This is a great way to train your brain and body on what it needs. Stack them, mix them, freeze them, microwave them, reuse them. There are so many things you can do with these clear food storage containers, you’ll never go back to plastic bags or tupper ware again! Product Comes With: 3 glass containers with 2 compartments inside each; each holds up to 36 ounces 6 sauce containers Beautiful gift box with logo and directions on front","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7120Dtj436L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lofte","source_asin":"B0772NKR6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0772NKR6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0772NKR6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
