window.products.push({"id":857533,"name":"The Grandparent Gift Frame Wall Decor, First Grandson","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177EVObhTL.jpg","description":"Any loving grandparent would be proud to display a treasured portrait of their first grandson along with an endearing First Grandson poem. The 8x10 table top or wall frame includes space for a 5x7 photo and poem and is suitable for many home or office decor styles. The frame, for new grandparents features black with a double white and black mat and is proudly Made in USA. The First grandson frame is a great gender reveal gift, baby shower gift for grandparents, gift for friends or family becoming grandparents for the first time, or for those expecting a first grandson.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177EVObhTL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Grandparent Gift Co.","source_asin":"B00BM71MYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM71MYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM71MYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":857534,"name":"Your Chair Covers - 14 x 108 inch Lace Table Runner White, Lace Table Runner for Weddings, Events, Hotels and Catering Services","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t8pe9yZ8L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"If tablecloths offer the excellent foundation for a stylish table setting, lace table runners definitely make the perfect finishing touches. Delicate White Lace Table Runners embellished with intricate cutwork and floral patterns dress the table in classic style. Whether you're planning a formal banquet or an intimate wedding, these table runners will fit any theme or concept that you may have. CARE INSTRUCTION. Hand wash with warm water. Hang to dry. For an enhanced look, we recommend using chair covers and tablecloths in complementing colors. For more information about table linen sizes, please use this tablecloth sizing chart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t8pe9yZ8L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUR CHAIR COVERS","source_asin":"B01NBW7K6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NBW7K6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NBW7K6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":857535,"name":"800 Thread Count Split Corner Dust Ruffle Bed Skirt White Solid 100% Egyptian Cotton Queen (60\" x 80\") with 19\" Drop Length.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iRKMCNFyL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"This solid white 800 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton three sided dust ruffle bed skirt comes with SPLIT corners. It will ensure that your bed looks its best at all times. We use different fabric for Bed Skirt’s platform is meant to be placed between Box Spring and the Mattress. The cotton fabric is machine washable for quick and easy care. CARE: Machine wash on cold. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iRKMCNFyL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scala","source_asin":"B077YT7BDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077YT7BDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077YT7BDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
