window.products.push({"id":857566,"name":"Madhu International Velvet Curtains – Bedroom Curtains with Rod Pocket – Window Drapery for Living Room – Printed Floral Design Thick Plush Luxury Vel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910Dz4hOkYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>♥ BEDROOM CURTAIN WITH SUPERIOR QUALITY: Madhu International window curtain is made from soft velvet fabric with handmade woven technique, it can give you pure luxury and soft plush feel. The shiny velvet fabric is breathable, fadeless, and durable. The package includes 1 curtain panel, which measures 50 inches in width by 63 inches long which is ideal to cover large space. </p> <p>♥ DESIGNER CURTAINS TO MATCH THE WALLS: This velvet curtain comes with an eye-catching design and elegant Black color that goes well with everything inside. It features attractive Flower imprints which are printed using HD printing technology to ensure that the prints do not fade easily. These readymade pink curtains are fully lined and ready to hang. </p> <p>♥ LIVING ROOM CURTAIN WITH ADDED BENEFITS: Make a smart choice today by bringing these bohemian curtains home. The thermal regulation of this long curtain helps to Semi block the sunlight and UV rays and offers you a dark pleasant environment even in the day. It also restricts unwanted eyes from peeping into your house, so you can enjoy privacy with family members and friends to the utmost. </p> <p>♥ EASY TO HANG MODERN CURTAINS: Our door window curtains are extremely simple to hang, just insert the rod through the rod pocket, and you are done! It comes with a built-in 2.5-inch rod pocket which makes it ideal to fit curtain rods up to 2.5\" in diameter. This privacy curtain adds glamorous sophistication to your kitchen, children's room, living room, bedroom, or any other room </p> <p>♥ WASHING INSTRUCTION: This thermal curtain is low maintenance and easy to clean. Our velvet blackout curtain is machine washable and hands washable in cold water so that they will not drop their colors. Do not bleach. </p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910Dz4hOkYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madhu International","source_asin":"B0B215XZK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B215XZK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B215XZK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
