window.products.push({"id":857669,"name":"Antique Bronze Brass Cremation Urn - Low Profile Vignette Model fremation urn for Human Ashes - Suitable for Cemetery Burial or Niche - Large Size fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pwx9pM5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liliane Memorials Brass Cremation Urns Vignette Urn Funeral urn is handcrafted of 100% brass and finished in antique brass.  The complex artisanal work includes an engraved circular leaf design.  Time-honored design offers an elegant resting place for your loved one.  Attractive urn will fit well with any decor, particularly on a mantel over a fireplace or in a library.  The Vignette Urn evokes the memory of your loved one in a traditional and timeless design. About Liliane's Memorial Urns Our handcrafting process results in slight variations in color or finish, making each urn a unique work of art. Our urns offer a threaded lid that allows you to safely and securely handle or transport the urn. A felt-lined bottom is standard on all of our urns to protect your fine furniture. Liliane's urns are maintenance free; simply wipe the hand-made brass urn with a clean dry cloth. All of our urns are wrapped in an plush cotton bag and securely packed in a box. Urn has a capacity of 180 cubic inches, which should fit the remains of adults weighing up to 180 lbs. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We trust that you will be happy with the quality and design of our products If you are not happy with the design you selected, please return your unused urn to Amazon for a full credit and select another Liliane Memorial Urn. Unfortunately, given the personal nature of funeral urns we cannot accept returns after you have used the urn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pwx9pM5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liliane Memorials","source_asin":"B07PJCWS19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PJCWS19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PJCWS19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":857670,"name":"yoyomax 88'' Upholstery Sleeper Sofa, Sectional Sofa Bed with Storage Chaises, Reversible Couch w/Pull Out Bed & Storage Space, Dark Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JYEdzMXwL._AC_.jpg","description":"3 in 1 Design - YOYOMAX upholstery sectional sofa has exquisite square armrest and backrest with a crisp design and broad double lines. It's absolutely a good idea for placement in living room, apartments, studios to meet different needs of reading, entertaining or sleeping. Free Combination - Each piece of the modular sectional sofa is removable. You really can build out your own custom design with the various pieces, and it's completely up to you depending on what look you're going for or what your needs are. You can choose different placement according to your preference. Best Choice for Rest - The sleeper sofa is a piece of furniture that would function as many things, a sofa obviously, configured right it would be a good bed for overnighters. When you combine it into a sleeper sofa, it can be the perfect length for a nap as a sofa while depth to lie on for a movie. Easy assembly - The sectional sofa is partial assembly needed. It's easy to follow instructions to assemble and we provide all tools. Overall sofa size: 34.65'' H X 88'' W X 57.87'' D. The sectional sleeper sofa comes in 3 packages that may arrive separately within different days. 1 Year Warranty - YOYOMAX are adhering to the concept of \"One Year Warranty, Lifetime Service\" and put our customer as our first priority. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us with any problems. Our after-sales service is always ready to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JYEdzMXwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yoyomax","source_asin":"B0BYCYNS9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYCYNS9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYCYNS9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
