window.products.push({"id":857709,"name":"2Pcs St. Patrick's Day Gnomes Plush Elf Decorations Mr and Mrs Green Faceless Irish Home Table Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xOI0+bCLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lucky Couples St.Patrick's Day Gnomes, Cute Mr & Mrs Faceless Plush Elf. A.) Mr Gnomes has green hat with shamrock, long white beard, a large bulbous nose. Mrs Gnome is cuter！ She has long braids and is very charming. B.) KVISTER St.Patrick's Day Gnomes are mainly made of high quality felt material. Their bodies are padded with fabric. The base is sand, which makes them heavy enough to stand on well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xOI0+bCLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TiurDin","source_asin":"B09P8RWP3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P8RWP3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P8RWP3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":857710,"name":"B’WELL Glass Cups – Coffee Travel Mug – Reusable Coffee Cup – Glass Travel Mug – Tea Travel Mug – Silicone Lid & Base – Hot And Cold Drinks – Dishwash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XSJVwiRNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"By using a glass reusable coffee mug you will prevent unnecessary plastic pollution and you will positively support the environment. Moreover, a reusable glass coffee cup looks way more stylish and elegant than disposable coffee cups and healthier than any other materials. Why is Borosilicate Glass better than regular glass? - Not all glass is created equally. The Borosilicate glass is thermal shock resistant - It will not become cloudy over time; the glass will be as clear as the day you bought it - It’s lighter than regular glass - The Glass will not produce condensation on the outer layer when filled with a cold beverage - It makes drinks taste better. When you use borosilicate glass the liquid inside remains pure, because borosilicate glass has low solubility, keeping your beverage contaminant free - In terms of overall performance, borosilicate glass is far superior to regular glass. Because of its durability and resistance to chemical changes, it has been traditionally used in chemistry labs as well as for kitchenware and premium glasses. Borosilicate glass is a significant upgrade from traditional glass, and because of its superior quality, it is often priced higher -For your drinking pleasure, our Double Wall Glass Cups are insulated to keep your drinks hot or cold for extended periods of time. In addition, the double wall glass structure ensures that the glass remains cool to touch! Beverages appear to float inside the inner layer of the clear glass. Moreover, the silicone lid & base are made up of 100% food-grade silicone, non-toxic and Eco-friendly with an attractive, ergonomic and practical design. An eco-friendly reusable glass cup is just one step we can take towards a smarter & more sustainable lifestyle. Replace your disposable single use cups, with the innovative B’WELL reusable travel cups! It is time to change the way you drink!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XSJVwiRNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B'WELL","source_asin":"B07HL2L1M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HL2L1M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HL2L1M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
