window.products.push({"id":857808,"name":"Goplus 5ft Snow Flocked Pencil Christmas Tree, Premium Hinged Slim Tree, with Mixed Pine Needles, Red Berries and Metal Base, 100% New PVC Material, f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vJvmmEw3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🎄Full Shape with Lush Look — The artificial Christmas tree features ultra lush branch tips and stands 5 feet tall. High dense branch tips lead to a lifelike and natural style, with the aim of creating a festival atmosphere. Additionally, fluffing and shaping the branches helps you get a Christmas tree of full-bodied look. 🎄Hinged Design for Easy Set-up — It is fairly easy for anyone to assemble the Christmas tree thanks to the convenient hinged sections, taking short time. Can be disassembled for simple and space saving storage, allowing you to make full use of it year after year. More, sturdy metal base keeps the tree as stable as possible, unlikely to fall over. 🎄100% New PVC Materials — The Christmas tree is consisted of 100% new PVC materials, superior to recycled materials either in using durability or safety. Also, odor free new material makes it a family-friendly decoration, which is non-flammable and non-allergic as well. In this way, you can feel confident to place it in your house. 🎄Snow Flocked Needles with Red Berries — Embrace the wintery, snowy season with this gorgeous tree that features branches covered in white, freshly fallen snow that adds rustic charm to your living room. While numerous vivid red berries color makes the Christmas tree with eye-catching appearance. 🎄Celebrate Christmas & Spread Festive Spirit — The Christmas tree will increase the festive atmosphere and spread the festival spirit. You can place a selection of ornaments to decorate the Christmas tree with your family for a wonderfully festive effect. Let the Christmas be in a perfect placement, with enchanting smell of the holidays encompass your every room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vJvmmEw3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goplus","source_asin":"B08GYGWXGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GYGWXGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GYGWXGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
