window.products.push({"id":857889,"name":"Stainless Steel Perforated Pizza Turning Peel with Handle Detachable Wood for Pizza Oven, Extra Long 47\", 9\" Round Pizza Peel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x5BouWPaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Pizza Peel- Thinner than wooden pizza peel, easy to clean and maintain. Stronger than aluminum pizza peel, not easy to deform. Dishwasher Safe: you can screw the stainless steel pizza paddle off and put it in the dishwasher. Perforated Design - The perforated metal paddle allows air flow under the dough, to prevents dough stick to a metal surface. Flour can leak from holes, so you can bake a crisper pizza without extra flour. Detachable Wood Handle - The natural beech wood handle with a smooth surface, beautiful and durable. Easy to disassemble and store.This pretty wooden handle can be assembled into two lengths of 32-in or 47-in, to keep you away from the oven to prevent burns. Make a Perfect Pizza - The key is use a round metal pizza turning peel to rotate the pizza and allow it to cook evenly.It's very difficult to turn with a wooden or rectangular metal peel. Geesta pizza turning peel is the most versatile option if you only want one. All kinds of Ovens - Choosing the best length 32 or 47 inch overall, Geesta Pizza Turning Peel be used in all kind of ovens - wooden, gas or electrical, home ovens or professionals ones. It will also be a practical gift for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x5BouWPaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geesta","source_asin":"B0912JFT7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-857889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912JFT7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912JFT7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
